=== DACA APAR ERORI ===

- "running scripts is disabled" la Activate.ps1:
  Set-ExecutionPolicy -Scope CurrentUser RemoteSigned

- "python not found": instaleaza Python de pe python.org
  (bifeaza "Add python.exe to PATH"), apoi deschide un terminal nou.

- "Eroare de conexiune" / "Nu mă pot conecta la server" in aplicatia de mobil:
  Verifica daca ai pus IP-ul corect de Wi-Fi in App.js (nu folosi IP de VirtualBox, gen 192.168.56.1). Verifica daca backend-ul ruleaza corect cu "--host 0.0.0.0".

- In chat nu apare raspunsul (pe mobil):
  Asigura-te ca in App.js structura de trimitere transforma corect istoricul in cerinta asteptata de FastAPI ( { "messages": [ { "role": "...", "content": "..." } ] } ).